{"title":"7g basket","notes":"This profile is optimized for the 7g Decent Basket.  You should weigh 7g of beans and dose them into the center mini-basket at the bottom.  You'll need a small 36mm tamper.  The flow rate is slowed down to prevent disturbing the puck.  A lower pressure is used to compensate for the lower puck integrity.  Final shot weight should be 18 to 28 grams.","type":"advanced","version":"2","author":"Decent","beverage_type":"espresso","tank_temperature":0.0,"steps":[{"name":"preinfusion temp boost","temperature":90.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":2.4,"seconds":2.0,"volume":0,"weight":null,"exit":{"type":"pressure","condition":"over","value":4.5}},{"name":"preinfusion","temperature":90.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":2.4,"seconds":6.0,"volume":0,"weight":null,"exit":{"type":"pressure","condition":"over","value":4.5}},{"name":"forced rise","temperature":90.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"pressure","transition":"fast","pressure":7.5,"flow":0.0,"seconds":3.0,"volume":0,"weight":null,"limiter":{"value":6.0,"range":1.0}},{"name":"rise and hold","temperature":90.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"pressure","transition":"fast","pressure":7.5,"flow":0.0,"seconds":3.0,"volume":0,"weight":null,"limiter":{"value":6.0,"range":1.0}},{"name":"decline","temperature":90.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"pressure","transition":"smooth","pressure":4.5,"flow":0.0,"seconds":10.0,"volume":0,"weight":null,"limiter":{"value":6.0,"range":1.0}}],"target_weight":35.0,"target_volume":36.0,"target_volume_count_start":3,"grinder_dose_weight":18.0,"legacy_profile_type":"settings_2c","lang":"","hidden":0,"crema":{"autoTare":true,"roast":null,"stopOnWeight":true,"tags":[]}}
{"title":"Blooming Allongé","notes":"An amazing long espresso for light roasts, this is a fruit bomb of a brewing method. 5:1 ratio, 60 seconds, very fine grind. If close to the right pressure, make 0.5g dose adjustments to get to an 8-9 bar peak. The very high flow rate means small grind adjustments cause big pressure changes. A very advanced technique, extractions average 26%.","type":"advanced","version":"2","author":"Decent","beverage_type":"espresso","tank_temperature":0.0,"steps":[{"name":"fast pre start","temperature":95.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":4.5,"seconds":2.0,"volume":500,"weight":null},{"name":"fast pre","temperature":95.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":4.5,"seconds":3.0,"volume":500,"weight":null,"exit":{"type":"pressure","condition":"over","value":3.5}},{"name":"ramp down pre","temperature":93.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"smooth","pressure":0.0,"flow":2.0,"seconds":15.0,"volume":500,"weight":null,"exit":{"type":"pressure","condition":"over","value":3.5}},{"name":"bloom","temperature":93.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":0.0,"seconds":30.0,"volume":500,"weight":null},{"name":"ramp","temperature":92.5,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"smooth","pressure":0.0,"flow":3.5,"seconds":7.0,"volume":500,"weight":null},{"name":"hold at 3.5 ml/s","temperature":91.0,"sensor":"coffee","pump":"flow","transition":"fast","pressure":0.0,"flow":3.5,"seconds":60.0,"volume":500,"weight":null,"limiter":{"value":8.6,"range":0.6}}],"target_weight":135.0,"target_volume":180.0,"target_volume_count_start":0,"grinder_dose_weight":18.0,"legacy_profile_type":"settings_2c","lang":"","hidden":0,"crema":{"autoTare":true,"roast":"light","stopOnWeight":true,"tags":[]}}
